  return `<div class="ads-workspace"><div class="section-toolbar ads-toolbar"><div><span class="eyebrow">NITRO ADS COMMAND CENTER</span><h2>Plan campaigns people actually act on.</h2><p>Go from offer to targeting, copy, creative, budget, tracking, and launch QA.</p></div><button class="btn btn-primary" data-workspace-action="campaign">+ Build campaign</button></div><section class="glass-card ads-hero"><div class="ads-hero-copy"><span class="ads-live-pill"><i></i> STRATEGY WORKSPACE</span><h3>Turn one clear offer into a complete launch kit.</h3><p>Nitro chooses the channel, maps the conversion path, writes ready-to-paste ads, directs the creative, and gives you the exact launch checklist.</p><div class="ads-hero-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-workspace-action="campaign">Build with Nitro</button><a class="btn" href="#content">Make the creative</a></div></div><div class="ads-funnel" aria-hidden="true"><span><b>01</b>Offer</span><i></i><span><b>02</b>Audience</span><i></i><span><b>03</b>Creative</span><i></i><span><b>04</b>Conversion</span></div></section><div class="stat-grid ads-stat-grid">${stat('Campaigns',campaigns.length,campaigns.length?'Saved launch kits':'Ready to build','◈')}${stat('Launch ready',ready,ready?'Ready or active':'Complete a campaign brief','✓')}${stat('Active',active,active?'Tracking inside Nitro':'Mark live campaigns active','↗')}${stat('Creative assets',content.length,content.length?'Available in Content Studio':'Create your first ad','✦')}</div><section class="ads-playbooks"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Start with a proven campaign type</h3><p>Pick the path that matches how customers discover you.</p></div><span>3 PLAYBOOKS</span></div><div class="ads-playbook-grid">${AD_PLAYBOOKS.map((x,i)=>`<button class="glass-card ad-playbook" data-campaign-template="${i}"><span class="ad-playbook-icon">${x.icon}</span><small>${x.channel}</small><b>${x.title}</b><p>${x.copy}</p><strong>Use playbook →</strong></button>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="ads-campaigns"><div class="panel-head"><div><h3>Your campaigns</h3><p>Saved strategy, creative direction, and launch status in one place.</p></div><span>${campaigns.length} TOTAL</span></div>${campaigns.length?`<div class="ads-campaign-list">${campaignCards}</div>`:`<div class="glass-card ads-empty"><div class="ads-empty-visual"><span>HEADLINE</span><b>Your best offer belongs here.</b><i></i><small>Audience · Creative · CTA</small></div><div><span class="eyebrow">FIRST CAMPAIGN</span><h3>Stop guessing what to run.</h3><p>Give Nitro the offer, customer, location, and budget. You will get a specific launch kit instead of a generic marketing outline.</p><button class="btn btn-primary" data-workspace-action="campaign">Build my first campaign</button></div></div>`}</section></div>`;
